  "slug": "what-are-you-studying",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/14747_what-are-you-studying.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: What are you studying?",
    "B: I'm learning Chinese.",
    "A: Do you have a Chinese teacher?",
    "B: I have two Chinese teachers who are also my good friends.",
    "A: Do you study at home?",
    "B: No, I study in a Chinese school. I have thirty classmates.",
    "A: How long have you been learning Chinese?",
    "B: I have been learning Chinese for three years and am now at HSK Level 4.",
    "A: Awesome!",
    "B: But my Chinese characters are not good. I can read many Chinese characters but not write them.",
    "A: It doesn’t matter, just practice more and you’ll be fine!",
    "B: My teacher said the same."
  ],
  "english_full": "A: What are you studying?\n\nB: I'm learning Chinese.\n\nA: Do you have a Chinese teacher?\n\nB: I have two Chinese teachers who are also my good friends.\n\nA: Do you study at home?\n\nB: No, I study in a Chinese school. I have thirty classmates.\n\nA: How long have you been learning Chinese?\n\nB: I have been learning Chinese for three years and am now at HSK Level 4.\n\nA: Awesome!\n\nB: But my Chinese characters are not good. I can read many Chinese characters but not write them.\n\nA: It doesn’t matter, just practice more and you’ll be fine!\n\nB: My teacher said the same.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "A: Что ты изучаешь?",
    "B: Я изуча́ю кита́йский язык.",
    "A: У тебя есть кита́йский наста́вник?",
    "B: У меня два кита́йских наста́вника, которые та́кже мои́ хоро́шие дру́зья.",
    "A: Ты учишься до́ма?",
    "B: Нет, я учусь в кита́йской шко́ле. У меня тридцать однокла́ссников.",
    "A: Как до́лго ты изуча́ешь кита́йский язык?",
    "B: Я изуча́ю кита́йский язык уже три года и сейча́с на у́ровне HSK 4.",
    "A: Внуша́ющий страх!",
    "B: Но мои́ кита́йские зна́ки не хоро́шие. Я могу́ чита́ть мно́гие кита́йские зна́ки, но не могу́ их писать.",
    "A: Ничего́ страшного, просто тре́нируйся больше, и всё будет хорошо́!",
    "B: Мой наста́вник ска́зал то́ же са́мое."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: Chto ty izuchayesh'?",
    "B: Ya izuchayu kitayskiy yazyk.",
    "A: U tebya yest' kitayskiy nastavnik?",
    "B: U menya dva kitayskikh nastavnika, kotorye takzhe moyi khoroshie druz'ya.",
    "A: Ty uchish'sya doma?",
    "B: Net, ya uchus' v kitayskoy shkole. U menya tridtsat' odnoklassnikov.",
    "A: Kak dolgo ty izuchayesh' kitayskiy yazyk?",
    "B: Ya izuchayu kitayskiy yazyk uzhe tri goda i seychas na urovne HSK 4.",
    "A: Vnushayushchiy strakh!",
    "B: No moyi kitayskie znaki ne khoroshie. Ya mogu chitat' mnogie kitayskie znaki, no ne mogu ikh pisat'.",
    "A: Nichego strashnogo, prosto treniruy'sya bol'she, i vsyo budet khorosho!",
    "B: Moy nastavnik skazal to zhe samoye."
  ],
